{"name": "Treetopians", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High above the ground, hidden among the branches, a new kind of community takes shape. In Treetopians, you guide a group of villagers as they build a vertical village in the canopy, striving to balance survival, growth, and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/19fa391b94d4eb46996b80b636a16c13.poster.avif?t=1785162184\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/19fa391b94d4eb46996b80b636a16c13.webm?t=1785162184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> What begins as a fragile settlement on a single tree soon becomes a living world, where every choice leaves a mark on your people\u2019s future</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/6c65a358dfa9ad2071a1e56d104daf30.poster.avif?t=1785162184\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/6c65a358dfa9ad2071a1e56d104daf30.webm?t=1785162184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/6c65a358dfa9ad2071a1e56d104daf30.mp4?t=1785162184\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treetopians is a cozy 3D colony simulator with a focus on vertical city-building, character needs, and emergent stories. Each procedurally generated tree offers new challenges, climates, and resources. You\u2019ll assign jobs, gather materials, and construct homes, farms, and workshops across the different layers of the canopy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/f681a270244d2ffb7d261fe373178517.poster.avif?t=1785162184\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/f681a270244d2ffb7d261fe373178517.webm?t=1785162184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But survival is only the beginning. Your villagers seek more than food and shelter. They crave friendship, comfort, and purpose. Their personalities shape how they live, work, and relate to each other, leading to unique interactions and personal stories with every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/05c096bfccc875109cf330694552f94a.poster.avif?t=1785162184\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/05c096bfccc875109cf330694552f94a.webm?t=1785162184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the goals of one tree are met, a hot air balloon carries part of your community to the next. With every journey, you decide who to take with you, shaping a generational narrative where bonds, sacrifices, and memories carry forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a game of strategy and care, where gentle creativity meets deep social dynamics, and every village tells its own story among the treetops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/65abccb5197635287eda76fcae38207a.poster.avif?t=1785162184\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/65abccb5197635287eda76fcae38207a.webm?t=1785162184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Treetopians is a cozy colony simulator where players build vertical villages in the treetops and care for a growing community of villagers with unique needs and personalities.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/e21dfd3e9e0b2045669dd357fd1c7dedd3b65b57/header.jpg?t=1785162184", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Cozy", "City Builder", "Cute", "Building", "Nature", "Comedy"], "developers": "Aparato Games", "publishers": "Aparato Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3967310", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "21 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/UrXIy8BRNCU", "first_seen": 1779314400.0, "review_rank": 599}